{
    "_comment": "(11.11) The Foreman in the Core, in one of the Core's structures (a control desk if there is one) - only after Milo was beaten with the Peace Gun (story/foreman.py). He gives the Old Note (lore item 3/3, for Milo in the Void) - he wrote it. Flag foreman:note.",
    "partner": "foreman",
    "start": [
        {
            "if": {
                "item": "Broken Bulb",
                "not_flag": "lore_used:Broken Bulb"
            },
            "goto": "bulb_notice"
        },
        {
            "if": {
                "flag": "foreman:note"
            },
            "goto": "again"
        },
        "note"
    ],
    "nodes": {
        "note": {
            "do": {
                "flag": "foreman:note"
            },
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_01",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "nervous",
                    "text": "Psst. Over here. Don't make that face - it's me."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_02",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "worried",
                    "text": "I heard the heart stop. The whole Factory went quiet. First time in... I don't know how long."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_03",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "nervous",
                    "text": "So I came up. I know, I know. 'I've always worked down there.' Not today."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_04",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Listen. I forgot to give you something. No - that's a lie. I didn't forget. I kept it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_05",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "serious",
                    "text": "It's old. I wrote it, a long time ago. It might change your life. Or what's left of it."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_06",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "sad",
                    "text": "I'm sorry I didn't give it to you sooner. I should have. Back at the line, when you helped me.",
                    "do": {
                        "give": "Old Note"
                    }
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_07",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "neutral",
                    "text": "There's someone down there who should read it. You'll know who."
                }
            ]
        },
        "again": {
            "random_line": true,
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_08",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "nervous",
                    "text": "I'm not going back down. Not yet."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_09",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "worried",
                    "text": "The heart's so quiet. I keep waiting for it to start again."
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_core_10",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "tired",
                    "text": "Did you give it to them? ...No, don't tell me. Just do it."
                }
            ]
        },
        "bulb_notice": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "foreman_32",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "suspicious",
                    "text": "Hold on. What's that in your pocket?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "foreman_33",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "nervous",
                    "text": "Is that... glass?"
                }
            ],
            "choices": [
                {
                    "text": "Show him the broken bulb.",
                    "goto": "dialogue:foreman_bulb"
                },
                {
                    "text": "Nothing.",
                    "goto": "carry_on"
                }
            ]
        },
        "carry_on": {
            "lines": [
                {
                    "id": "foreman_34",
                    "who": "foreman",
                    "pose": "suspicious",
                    "text": "Nothing. Sure. Everybody's got nothing in their pocket."
                }
            ],
            "then": [
                {
                    "if": {
                        "flag": "foreman:note"
                    },
                    "goto": "again"
                },
                "note"
            ]
        }
    }
}
